.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd September 27, 2026
.Dt MAN.CONF 5
.Os OxideBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm man.conf
.Nd manual directories
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The file
.Pa /etc/man.conf
tells
.Xr man 1
where to look for manual pages.
Each line is a directive and its argument; empty lines and lines starting
with
.Ql #
are ignored.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic manpath Ar directory
Search
.Ar directory ,
which holds
.Pa man1 ,
.Pa man2
and so on.
Directories are searched in the order given.
.It Ic output Ar option Op Ar value
Accepted for compatibility with
.Xr mandoc 1 ;
ignored.
.El
.Pp
Without a
.Ic manpath
line the directories are
.Pa /usr/share/man
and
.Pa /usr/local/share/man .
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/man.conf -compact
.It Pa /etc/man.conf
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
manpath /usr/share/man
manpath /usr/local/share/man
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr man 1
.Sh HISTORY
The file format is that of
.Ox 5.8 .
